msgid "(Not bad...)"
msgstr "Non male..."

msgctxt "644"
msgid "(Hmm... Decisions, decisions...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "Your eyes. I always look at someone's eyes when I meet them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid "My eyes? Okay, huh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "So, like... What do you think? About my eyes, I mean."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "They're beautiful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid ""
"Hehehe... Thanks. You have really pretty eyes too, Kiryu-san. "
"<Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid "Heh, thanks."
msgstr "Eh, grazie."

msgctxt "728"
msgid "Your lips, for sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid "My lips...? Okay, huh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid "I mean, there's a lotta guys out there who like my lips."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "Davvero?"

msgctxt "776"
msgid ""
"Yeah, they tell me all the time, \"Oh, man, I'm totally in love with your "
"lips!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid ""
"I mean, I get it. I like a good set of sexy lips, too. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid "I think I'm a hands guy, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid "Hands? Wow, it's so cool that we've got the same thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "I love it when a woman has beautiful, slender fingers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid ""
"Ooohh... You know, I can do some pretty smooth and sexy movements with my "
"hands 'cause of all my dancing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid ""
"When you're belly dancing, you have to focus on every part of your body, "
"even your fingertips, or your dancing is gonna suck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid ""
"I reaaaally want you to see me belly dancing, Kiryu-san. "
"<Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid "Your legs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid "My legs...? Huh, okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "896"
msgid ""
"I'm wearing a long dress today, though. Sorry to like, disappoint. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "908"
msgid "I'll admit, it's a bit disappointing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "920"
msgid ""
"You know, I'm pretty proud of my legs, especially since I do all that "
"dancing. I stretch a whole lot, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "932"
msgid ""
"Next time you're free, you should totally come see me do my belly dancing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "944"
msgid "Your hair... I love girls with long, beautiful hair."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "956"
msgid "My hair... Okay, huh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "968"
msgid ""
"I can totally get that. They say that a woman's hair is like, basically her "
"life, after all. And I do put a ton of work into it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "980"
msgid ""
"Also, when I do a hair flip, you can smell the amazing scents I put into it."
" Isn't that like, awesome?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "992"
msgid "Yeah, I definitely like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1004"
msgid "Your... chest."
msgstr "Il tuo... seno?"

msgctxt "1016"
msgid ""
"Ohmigosh, you are so funny! I mean, I guess you <Italic>are</Italic> a boy, "
"Kiryu-san. You can't help yourself. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1028"
msgid "What do you mean, boy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1040"
msgid "Hehehe... Nothing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1052"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1064"
msgid "Okay, I get it. You're not interested in me like, at all. Is that it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1076"
msgid "No, that's not it..."
msgstr "No, non è quello..."

msgctxt "1088"
msgid ""
"I mean, I was just starting to think like, maybe you'd be a cool "
"boyfriend..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1100"
msgid "But I guess I was totally wrong about you feeling that way about me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1112"
msgid "Sorry..."
msgstr "Scusa..."

msgctxt "1124"
msgid "(Her eyelids...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1136"
msgid "(How about her lips...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1148"
msgid "(Gotta be her hands...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1160"
msgid "(On her leg might be good...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1172"
msgid "(Her head...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1184"
msgid "(Gotta be her breasts.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1196"
msgid "(A tattoo, huh...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1208"
msgid "How about... your eyelids?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1220"
msgid "Ahahaha! Ohmigosh, what am I even gonna put on my eyelids?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1232"
msgid ""
"What, should I put like, eyeballs on them, so it looks like I'm awake when "
"I'm asleep? That'd be sooo hilarious!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1244"
msgid "Not a bad idea..."
msgstr "Non è una cattiva idea."

msgctxt "1256"
msgid ""
"You know, though, it's actually kind of a thing. Some people, like, inject "
"color into their skin to give them better eyebrows or permanent eyeshadow. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1268"
msgid "I never knew that was a thing..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1280"
msgid "How about your lips?"
msgstr "E i nostri pezzi grossi?"

msgctxt "1292"
msgid ""
"Wow, I'm surprised you like, actually know about lip tattoos, Kiryu-san. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1304"
msgid "Some people tattoo the underside of their bottom lip, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1316"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "Davvero?"

msgctxt "1328"
msgid "Hehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Isn't that totally weird?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1340"
msgid "Why don't you put it on your hand?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1352"
msgid "My hand? You know, that could be kind of cool."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1364"
msgid "And the right tattoo on the back of my hand could be pretty sexy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1376"
msgid ""
"Hehehe... Wow, Kiryu-san, you're like, super good at this. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1388"
msgid "How about putting one on your leg somewhere?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1400"
msgid ""
"Could be good. Ooh, it might be like, super sexy to put one right on my "
"inner thigh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1412"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "1424"
msgid ""
"You know, not too long ago, I was seriously considering putting a tattoo on "
"the sole of my foot. A little picture of the Buddha."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1436"
msgid "On the sole of your foot...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1448"
msgid "I ended up not going through with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1460"
msgid ""
"But a thigh tattoo sounds super sexy. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> You're like,"
" super good at this, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1472"
msgid "Heh, thanks."
msgstr "Eh, grazie."

msgctxt "1484"
msgid "Why not put one on your head?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1496"
msgid "Uh, but my hair'll just hide it, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1508"
msgid ""
"Ahahaha! Come on, like, really? Who would put a tattoo on top of their "
"head!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1520"
msgid ""
"I can't believe you said that with like, a straight face. You're so freaking"
" hilarious, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1532"
msgid "You've got to put one on your chest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1544"
msgid "My chest? But I've already got a tattoo there..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1556"
msgid ""
"If I'm gonna get a brand-new tattoo, I wanna, like, put it somewhere "
"different, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1568"
msgid "Oh... That makes sense."
msgstr "Ah, mi torna."

msgctxt "1580"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1592"
msgid "What, do you not like tattoos or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1604"
msgid "No, that's not it..."
msgstr "No, non è quello..."

msgctxt "1616"
msgid "Oh, well. I like them. They're like, so me."
msgstr ""

